ai-factory UI kit "shadcn"

The components under components/ui follow shadcn/ui (https://ui.shadcn.com), which is
MIT licensed; its licence is in components/ui/LICENSE and is copied into a repo together
with those components.

The other files (components/blocks, components/frame, lib) are ai-factory's own. A repo
the kit is scaffolded into owns its copies, as with shadcn/ui.

The packages the kit installs are listed in kit.json with exact versions; each comes
under its own licence (as the npm registry gives it for those versions):
- MIT: radix-ui, clsx, tailwind-merge, cmdk, sonner, react-day-picker, input-otp,
  @tanstack/react-table, recharts, next, react, react-dom, react-router, vite,
  @vitejs/plugin-react, tailwindcss, @tailwindcss/postcss, @tailwindcss/vite,
  tw-animate-css and the @types packages
- Apache-2.0: class-variance-authority, typescript
- ISC: lucide-react
- BSD-2-Clause: leaflet
The design's end-to-end tests add @playwright/test (Apache-2.0).
